  <item>
    <title>EP62-快手菜｜i人第一次摆摊，误入e人市集</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e7486d1e94ae6921cc6b57</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e7486d1e94ae6921cc6b57</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2026 09:52:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>天气暖和了，I人也出门社交了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一次，我们把小饭桌搬到了麦子店街的“大小咖啡”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢大小咖啡、大小电波和古寺老师的组织的“播客小集”，让“好饭不怕晚”第一次从线上走到了线下。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkf6Y_dC76jUqRs-DuqymXywjg33.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>第一次摆摊，带着手搓的海报、粗糙的手作、景迈山的茶叶，还有一点没准备好的慌张。</span></p><span></span><p><span>摆摊收入：35元（其中15元来自隔壁主包，20元来自一位幼儿园小朋友）+手链1条（10岁的谈判专家画饼先生馈赠）+新朋友若干+欢笑声n次。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的快手菜是一篇声音日记，是一些具体的瞬间，是在这个AI横行的赛博时代再一次确认：线下的真实的链接，很珍贵。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgVAWRY3MG4yMtp3Dttw4DOYJfhm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>p.s.&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>“快手菜”是我们新开的系列。顾名思义，这个系列的内容会相对短频快，一人开录。话题天南地北，随时开麦分享。虽然快手，但绝不预制！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63aff3b04ded9d81d0a11f51/llFtBoMRIIGjr0ifg2roJCPMseZT.m4a" length="17549800" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:18:04</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lt0vh5F55T5u81SrB4v_1CskIots.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP61-糟糕！又对生活crush了！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69b2951652cc900b9debd9a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69b2951652cc900b9debd9a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 12 Mar 2026 10:41:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目是为了</span></p><span></span><p><span>1、证明我们还没闹掰</span></p><span></span><p><span>2、证明我们对生活还有crush</span></p><span></span><p><span>3、希望你们也能快乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">3:35</a> 超实用的深圳旅行指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="653">10:53</a> 和高敏感家人相处的心得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1146">19:06</a> 深圳竟然也有很多美食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1355">22:35</a> 汉中游记：吃米皮、锅贴、看朱鹮、拜丞相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a> 你喜欢过年吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 你对生活祛魅了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2438">40:38</a> 好物分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>“入魅”清单：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>食物：</span></strong><span>花香蓝莓、鲜核桃、黄晶果、魏斯理汉堡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>B站博主</span></strong><span>：双下巴的反击、花神打喷嚏、BBGthisway</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>北京线下店铺：</span></strong><span>cozycow、三川咖啡、触温集</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>凑佳苗《山女日记》</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsU-jrduV4nSGTUpPytXb54J1Ngr.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>朱鹮</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuWRCaVcp6rIXdx3O-qqiB1P-jxQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>魏斯理汉堡</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgwc5uMIuZlXr44qKk2kxd8ED-tw.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>石塑粘土</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvLTxgAJzQoRdJ9VpQVDtH9D04w8.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>汉中锅贴</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjaxupxBG_HUPX6HNHUvCdYyHEP0.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>武侯祠的牌匾，中间蓝色底那块为果亲王作品</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqKLupeTmkI2CdnmIYKuS-8FQIJa.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>松下随身听，里面的磁带是孙燕姿《the moment》</span></blockquote>]]></description>
