  <item>
    <title>EP60-小众旅行地|大兴安岭追秋，不止额尔古纳河</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69253114e09dc0297ac05b03</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69253114e09dc0297ac05b03</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Nov 2025 04:40:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大兴安岭下期终于来了，经历了一段时间连滚带爬的工作，从一个城市牛马的视角再次回顾一个多月以前的大兴安岭之旅，想到大草原上自由自在的牛马，恍如隔世。这期我们继续大兴安岭自驾游的故事，有很多关于吃吃喝喝和购物的体验，都是干货，难免片面。大家各取所需就好。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 我们在傍晚抵达临江村，赶上恰好的夕阳，余晖照在额尔古纳河上，还有错过的晨雾。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">7:38</a> 前往奇乾村，途径白鹿岛上厕所，到额尔古纳河右岸原型，打卡中俄界碑，又爬了一个小山头。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a>经过根白线到达冷极根河——大兴安岭美食之都：酸菜排骨锅、冻豆腐、蒜泥血肠、野菜包子。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a> 开始回溯本次美食之旅：临江村难忘的晚餐（真正的避雷）、恩和的俄罗斯餐厅和河畔咖啡、额尔古纳顺城红焖羊肉锅。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2492">41:32</a> 海拉尔购物：早市大推荐、古城文创店、蒙源俄式面包房。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3325">55:25</a> 最美景色大评比：卡线还是太全面了！桃仔本次最大感悟：尽信书不能无书。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：高高的兴安岭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgqgSgLeZkIZ_09lc6eSeAWuGhAr.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>奇乾村</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgUkelxrccf-Ek1G7Pluj8XJt0j1.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>余晖照在额尔古纳河上</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljwkGeZDnoA2-FOhPbv0lo0SdkYf.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>一日奇乾，一生思念</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqARXy-JW7Q884XUjnI9u-DPZPGF.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>温柔的大兴安岭</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnH7Py-kg_mF68vmNKh0Z48kEHry.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>凛冽的松香味，霸总香水来源</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgpRnrBi6e0DAa_WVRRRARJ34F-n.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在恩和，河畔咖啡</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lq0B5aHwGlBHSwvOyHoIPb1b6CNa.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>不冻河秋色</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWgG81p9qk8THUwxjixh1Ws2jgv.JPG"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>热气腾腾的海拉尔河西早市</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63aff3b04ded9d81d0a11f51/lkH5MXhLb6E66rX5h-ZWDxJuRQur.m4a" length="67117319" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:55</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljtXiBl0Z9X2_YgOBfqGWcoJYgkk.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP59-小众旅行地|大兴安岭追秋，去往额尔古纳河右岸</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fe0091083a71a4eb4d6f55</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68fe0091083a71a4eb4d6f55</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Oct 2025 11:10:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近线上节目疏于更新，但线下生活很精彩。刚刚过去的十一假期，主播分两路旅行。本期节目先来分享阿修和桃仔的大兴安岭追秋之旅。我们和西宝、路痴本痴两位好朋友一起，在《额尔古纳河右岸》和《小红书》的指引下，途经331国道、卡线、根白线，一路抵达阿尔山、海拉尔、黑山头、恩和、临江、奇乾、根河，往大兴安岭的深处去，奔赴一场盛大的秋天。前两天刚好读到李娟的书，她写阿勒泰的秋天中，有这样的表述：“牛羊散在河边，细心地啃食草地。河岸边收割过的麦茬地泛着整齐的金黄，地势起伏动荡。白桦林的林梢，用雪白和金黄的颜色深入蓝天。”这是阿勒泰的秋天，也是大兴安岭的秋天。整段旅程都被秋天包裹住。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">7:40</a> 从阿尔山到海拉尔，一段极其艰辛的旅程：东北天黑得太早了，以及不要相信导航</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>路上的风景是最美的，被巨大的树林所震撼，感受季节和景观的巨大变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 卡线还是太全面了，如果你只有一个选择，就去卡线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 从临江村到白鹿岛再到奇乾村，听雪落下的声音</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a>阿尔山，来都来了，去不冻河看牛吃草，乌苏浪子湖晨雾也挺好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2460">41:00</a>从阿尔山到海拉尔，看到了绝美的夕阳，但上厕所真的没办法从从容容游刃有余</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 海拉尔，荒野中的一颗明珠，但莫日格勒河还是太复杂了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4119">1:08:39</a> 去小江马场对面的山头看额尔古纳湿地的日落，人生就是不断地爬坡，以及人生就是不断迟到永远充满遗憾啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4845">1:20:45</a> 从黑山头到恩和，卡线还是太美了，以及卡线隐藏版五星厕所。</span></p><span></span><p><span>下面是一些美丽的图：</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp1w4LI29qTV-_xKJRdpnENYrLBh.jpg"></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>阿尔山乌苏浪子湖晨雾</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmycPvTJt9gm0oir7tQuOgmlag0_.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>阿尔山不冻河</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnZAMVNdmXNHPty39XNqM1mjyK_b.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>莫日格勒河</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv_gZEu_RiUIBpO0eTesAtYJSokx.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>莫日格勒河（路人）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi_Aw-lWKILQJMAVtGN-WbN_Lqmj.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>黑山头购物点</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvE1uT3TgQcgsTaiwjWBQl18Y6jO.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>额尔古纳湿地（免费版）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmIu1kqrxMkjyROy1o0n6itedneV.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>去白鹿岛的路上，正式跨越到冬天</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmpz3lKHubI5msXr5K2ua25QZtB_.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>站在额尔古纳河右岸</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkMyX0q9lVDBr4DOLNI_BIcZUCiJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>还是在额尔古纳河右岸</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FopyD_w_RC0i35BuKJ74iiEMxyyd.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoeRrhAUkCw8fSHEz7FxlmaiW-h4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtyhYCf7_9tYQkkLeUTn-144tBAz.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkiwvoHgzJioJbi79e-egjcPZCjJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>相信我，有些风景只能在抵达中抵达。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63aff3b04ded9d81d0a11f51/llfgZHLba5RsyhTsUqkYqI5OAoIe.m4a" length="92071190" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:34:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5PwtOWDgoLpYpDtUkV4a4SjM_V.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP58-教你一招，获得最小单位的成功</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6898abae032793b18aaf21f5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6898abae032793b18aaf21f5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Aug 2025 14:39:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期我们聊了聊小游戏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从小到大，我们的生活都不缺乏小游戏的点缀，从Windows系统自带的扫雷、蜘蛛纸牌、空当接龙到俄罗斯方块、弹球大炮、贪吃蛇、推箱子等等风靡一时的游戏，再到我们一度沉迷的消除类游戏，还有如今人人都至少听说过的羊了个羊、抓大鹅这样依托小程序的游戏......小时候，它是我们快乐的源泉，后来又成为打发时光的工具，以及社交货币。这些游戏究竟为何吸引人？它们是缓解还是加重了焦虑？又或者成为无聊生活中唯一可以掌控的有趣的色彩？你有什么玩小游戏的心得吗？欢迎收听、留言、转发。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63aff3b04ded9d81d0a11f51/llkqq83GEsigobcgdBQk4m7jNZ21.m4a" length="53509264" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq-k7ODwdoLgkMJY48nYwRJRcw7Z.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP57-难道真的没人喜欢去KTV了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6885eb15a9dec92500629769</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6885eb15a9dec92500629769</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 27 Jul 2025 09:12:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>并非没人，还有我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们三个人一起去唱K啦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时隔许久的一次唱K，把我们又拉回了学生时代：</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>“我怀念的是通宵唱歌，</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我怀念的是一起熬夜，</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我怀念的是熬夜以后精神抖擞，</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>还是想要再能续一场🎵”</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>（以上改编创作来自栗子）</span></p><span></span><p><span>从大学生必备的期末周项目，到现在门可罗雀的“复古”娱乐，我们见证了KTV的兴起和衰落，KTV也留下了我们青春的黄金时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间点】（本期彩蛋多多，一定要听到最后哦）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 时隔许久一起唱K啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> 关于我们的KTV记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="773">12:53</a> KTV是i人还是e人的活动？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a> KTV的兴起与没落</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1357">22:37</a> 滋养我们音乐素养的台湾乐坛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1814">30:14</a> 同频的回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">35:45</a> KTV二三事——关于选曲与麦霸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3254">54:14</a> 娱乐方式，线上与线下</span></p><span></span><p><span>【今日推荐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱在西元前咖啡馆</span></p><span></span><p><span>打羽毛球</span></p><span></span><p><span>《彗星来的那一夜》</span></p>]]></description>
